<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-084" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:genealogy" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">刺史<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:genealogy:m0002" ref="jlw_330_62b">郗隆</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:genealogy:m0005" ref="66f_b00_777">慮</persName>之玄孫也，以兄子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:genealogy:m0014" ref="6lr_zci_i0j">鑒</persName>及諸子悉在洛陽，疑未決，悉召僚吏謀之。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">參軍<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0002" ref="r8g_22q_mi0">王邃</persName>鎮石頭，將士爭往歸之，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0015" ref="jlw_330_62b">隆</persName>遣從事於牛渚禁之，不能止。將士遂奉<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0033" ref="r8g_22q_mi0">邃</persName>攻<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0035" ref="jlw_330_62b">隆</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0037" ref="jlw_330_62b">隆</persName>父子及<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0041" ref="zbe_te9_5ic">顧彥</persName>皆死，傳首於<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-084-jin067-xilong:death:m0049" ref="ee0_b2a_68e">冏</persName>。</p>
</text>
